Id(), e);\n                    }\n                }\n                return new PyrisTutorSuggestionPipelineExecutionDTO(\n                    new PyrisCourseDTO(course),\n                    exerciseId,\n                    programmingExerciseDTO,\n                    textExerciseDTO,\n                    new PyrisPostDTO(post),\n                    pyrisDTOService.toPyrisMessageDTOList(session.getMessages()),\n                    new PyrisUserDTO(user),\n                    executionDto.settings(),\n                    executionDto.initialStages()\n                );\n            },\n            stages -> irisChatWebsocketService.sendStatusUpdate(session, stages)\n        );\n        // @formatter:on\n    }\n\n    /**\n     * Resolves the exercise a post relates to, if any.\n     * <p>\n     * A post can be associated with an exercise if it lives in a {@link Channel} that is linked to an exercise.\n     * Any error while resolving the (potentially lazily loaded) exercise is swallowed so that the tutor suggestion\n     * pipeline can still be executed without exercise details.\n     *\n     * @param post the post the tutor suggestion is requested for\n     * @return the exercise the post relates to, or {@code null} if it cannot be determined\n     */\n    private Exercise getExerciseForPost(Post post) {\n        try {\n            if (post.getConversation() instanceof Channel channel) {\n                return channel.getExercise();\n            }\n        }\n        catch (Exception e) {\n            log.warn(\"Could not resolve exercise for post {}\", post.getId(), e);\n        }", "numLines": 70, "startLine": 247, "totalLines": 444}}
